<title>USA: TENNIS-LEADING WOMEN'S RANKINGS ON WTA TOUR.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LEADING WOMEN'S RANKINGS ON WTA TOUR.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Florida 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading women's</p>
<p>tennis rankings as issued Saturday by the WTA Tour ahead of</p>
<p>the French Open, which begins Monday</p>
<p>1. Martina Hingis (Switzerland)</p>
<p>2. Steffi Graf (Germany)</p>
<p>3. Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) </p>
<p>4. Monica Seles (U.S.)</p>
<p>5. Lindsay Davenport (U.S.)</p>
<p>6. Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain)</p>
<p>7. Conchita Martinez (Spain)</p>
<p>8. Anke Huber (Germany)</p>
<p>9. Iva Majoli (Croatia)</p>
<p>10. Mary Pierce (France)</p>
<p>11. Amanda Coetzer (South Africa)</p>
<p>12. Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.)</p>
<p>13. Irina Spirlea (Romania)</p>
<p>14. Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands)</p>
<p>15. Karina Habsudova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>16. Kimberly Po (U.S.)</p>
<p>17. Sabine Appelmans (Belgium)</p>
<p>18. Barbara Paulus (Austria)</p>
<p>19. Judith Wiesner (Austria)</p>
<p>20. Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania)</p>
</text>
